  "query_preview": "/FRIDAY THROUGH TUESDAY/...\nIssued at 345 PM CDT Tue Sep 29 2026\n\nThe area then settles into a much more Fall-like pattern for Friday \nand into the weekend, with mild afternoon highs in the 60s to 70s \namid much drier air. This will also allow for overnight lows in the \nmiddle to upper 40s, which is much closer to average than we've seen \nfor much of the month of September. As upper ridging begins to \namplify across the western CONUS into early next week, temperatures \nwill begin to warm back into the upper 70s to low 80s across the \narea. This will also moderate overnight lows, with lows returning to \nwell above average in the middle to upper 50s early next week.",
